{"availability":"available","full":"WizisCool/oh-my-cpa","name":"oh-my-cpa","description":"Self-hosted control plane & usage observability console for CLIProxyAPI (CPA) — AI providers, client keys, streaming telemetry, and model cost snapshots.","category":"Developer tools","language":"Go","stars":196,"forks":12,"created":"2026-09-12T10:27:41Z","updated":"2026-10-15T12:20:04Z","license":"MIT","branch":"master","homepage":"https://omc-demo.junze.dev","topics":["ai-gateway","cliproxyapi","cpa","dashboard","golang","llm","observability","proxy","react","self-hosted","sqlite","telemetry"],"demo":"https://omc-demo.junze.dev/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T13:02:06.613Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-15T13:02:06.613Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-15T13:02:06.613Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T09:25:25.282Z","stars":94,"forks":5},{"at":"2026-10-09T23:11:53.463Z","stars":126,"forks":6},{"at":"2026-10-11T07:26:05.431Z","stars":178,"forks":8},{"at":"2026-10-15T13:02:06.613Z","stars":196,"forks":12}],"technologies":["React","Go"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Live Demo · Install · Features · Agents and MCP · Documentation · 简体中文","CLIProxyAPI (CPA) is an API gateway: it adapts protocols, holds credentials and proxies requests. Oh My CPA (OMC) is a web console for it. OMC manages the gateway's providers, credentials and configuration, and records the usage and cost of every request. It is a single Go binary with the React console embedded and a local SQLite database, runs offline, and signs in with CPA's management key."],"features":["AI providers: Codex, Claude, Gemini, Meta Muse, xAI, Vertex AI, Gemini Interactions, DeepSeek and OpenAI-compatible services, each with credentials, advanced model options, runtime retry/error policies, priority,…","OAuth management: sign in from the console for Codex, Claude, Antigravity, xAI, Kimi (kimi.com and kimi.ai), Devin and Meta Muse, or import a Vertex service account key. Auth files, manual token refresh, model lists,…","Client keys: create, name and revoke gateway API keys. Names appear in request records and filters.","Model catalog: pull model lists straight from upstream providers.","Playground: test any routed model with text and images, streamed multi-turn answers and request diagnostics."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/WizisCool/oh-my-cpa/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"b23beba3b3d7d36fe58274fe8b235ea825b505c356bbbc1297ca3c39f9e3092f","extractedAt":"2026-10-15T13:02:06.751Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T13:02:06.751Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Live Demo · Install · Features · Agents and MCP · Documentation · 简体中文","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/WizisCool/oh-my-cpa/blob/master/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"paid_service","status":"required","text":"Request recordsEvery request, filterable by model, provider, key, status and cost Cost & usageA price book matched from OpenRouter, with custom overrides OAuth managementSign in, inspect quota and configure each credential in one place AI providersEndpoints, models, priority and an enable switch enforced by the gateway","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/WizisCool/oh-my-cpa/blob/master/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"The console's sign-in password is CPA's management key.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/WizisCool/oh-my-cpa/blob/master/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Open and sign in with the CPAMANAGEMENTKEY value from .env.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/WizisCool/oh-my-cpa/blob/master/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"b23beba3b3d7d36fe58274fe8b235ea825b505c356bbbc1297ca3c39f9e3092f","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/WizisCool/oh-my-cpa/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-15T13:02:06.751Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-15T12:20:04Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/WizisCool/oh-my-cpa/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-15T13:02:06.